1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:06,884
In a multinational group? You may need to register for Top-up Tax.

2
00:00:07,004 --> 00:00:11,786
Every company, multinational groups, or listed only?

3
00:00:14,306 --> 00:00:20,214
Large multinational groups. Group revenue counts.

4
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:28,089
The FTA's test: group revenue of EUR 750m or more,

5
00:00:28,209 --> 00:00:32,093
in at least 2 of the 4 preceding years.

6
00:00:32,213 --> 00:00:34,955
First, four years of group revenue.

7
00:00:35,075 --> 00:00:38,488
Then, which UAE entities are in the group.

8
00:00:38,608 --> 00:00:44,080
And the registration timeline, with your tax agent.

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:49,216
We prepare and check the figures, with your tax agent.

10
00:00:49,336 --> 00:00:55,900
Close to the line? Message us on WhatsApp.
